    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 8.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Se ðe hit him to teo, sylle sixa sum ðone að, þæt he hit him swa to teo, swa hit him ðeofstolen wære.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who would claim the cattle [the accuser] must swear (as one of six) the oath: that he makes the claim [for the cattle] just as if they had been stolen by thieves.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Qui sibi repetit, det sex sol. iusiurandum, quod ita sibi attrahat, sicut ei furatum fuit.</ab>
      </div>
